# Fixture: europe_sell_goods' Europe base (60000 gold, tax 6%) with two ships in the harbor: a Galleon (selected) holding Cotton 40 /
# Rum 20 / Furs 10 and an empty Caravel behind it. Ship icons: Galleon x 146-163, Caravel x 165-177, y 148-161 (logical pixels).
# A mouse release over a ship icon opens its menu (FUN_38fd_2bfe, @EUROPESHIPCLICK + @EUROPESHIPOPTIONS); so do S, Space and Enter with a ship selected.
# Rows keep their DOS ids: Move to front, Set sail, [Unload all cargo only while a goods hold is occupied], No changes.
key e                    # open the European Status screen
wait 10
click 172 155            # Caravel icon: its menu has 3 rows (no cargo to unload)
click 150 92             # row 1 Move to front: harbor order becomes Caravel, Galleon; Caravel selected
click 172 155            # Galleon icon (now second): menu with 4 rows
click 150 121            # row 4 No changes: nothing happens
click 172 155            # Galleon menu again
key Escape               # Esc changes nothing either
click 200 155            # empty space of the Loading box: selects the first ship (the Caravel) but opens no menu
shot
key s                    # S opens the menu for the selected ship (3 rows: the Caravel is empty)
key Escape
key space                # Space opens it too
key Escape
key Return               # and so does Enter
click 150 115            # row 3 No changes
click 172 155            # Galleon icon: selects it, menu with 4 rows
key Escape
key s                    # S with the Galleon selected: its 4-row menu
click 150 109            # row 3 Unload all cargo: the holds are sold last first (Furs 10, Rum 20, Cotton 40)
wait 30
shot
key e                    # leave Europe
